## Installation

### From VS Code Marketplace (recommended)

1. Open **Extensions** sidebar in VS Code (`Cmd+Shift+X` / `Ctrl+Shift+X`)
2. Search for `{{ theme.name }}`
3. Click **Install**
4. Open Command Palette (`Cmd+Shift+P` / `Ctrl+Shift+P`)
5. Select **Preferences: Color Theme**
6. Choose {% for v in variants %}**{{ theme.name }} {{ v.variant.name }}**{% if not loop.last %} or {% endif %}{% endfor %}

### From Open VSX (for Cursor, VSCodium, etc.)

1. Open **Extensions** sidebar
2. Search for `{{ theme.name }}`
3. Click **Install**
4. Select **Preferences: Color Theme**
5. Choose {% for v in variants %}**{{ theme.name }} {{ v.variant.name }}**{% if not loop.last %} or {% endif %}{% endfor %}

Or install directly from [Open VSX](https://open-vsx.org/extension/{{ adapter.publisher }}/{{ theme.id }}-theme).

